  "claims": [
    "Explicit eighteen-law Cell derivations for all eleven old wire roots, treating wire/type parameters opaquely and without whole-wire normalization APIs.",
    "For each root code, generated Cell constructor count and new-root count equal the exact fixed profiles below, universally over parameters.",
    "Every uncontextualized root expansion has at most 66 Cell constructors and 20 new-root uses. Every contextual old wire Step expands using at most 20 new-root uses, including inverse equality uses.",
    "New-root count equals the actual step occurrences in Cell.toTrack. Every old pure proof track expands with at most twenty times its old step count.",
    "The unified mixed catalogue gains a bounded definitional higher comparison for one contextual old wire Step versus its explicit expansion; old higher proofs embed compositionally with exact support and count.",
    "Every unified mixed Step and Track has an expanded track and a constructed comparison preserving its exact full guard set.",
    "A label-count function proves that expanded mixed tracks contain zero old-wire primitive labels, also under mixed seq/tensor contexts.",
    "Expanded mixed track step uses are at most twenty times source mixed step uses.",
    "Previously supplied higher comparisons transport to expanded boundary tracks with exact support; comparison internals may still use previous-library generators.",
    "Full-state correlated-joint repair uses the unchanged footprint in an updated checked model."
  ],
